1
00:00:07,804 --> 00:00:09,854
♪ SHINY SWORD, MY DIAMOND ♪

2
00:00:09,854 --> 00:00:11,474
( singing in Japanese )

3
00:00:23,114 --> 00:00:24,154
♪ IT’S TIME ♪

4
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:25,784
( singing in Japanese )

5
00:00:41,714 --> 00:00:43,634
♪

6
00:01:34,384 --> 00:01:36,514
( goblins chuckling,
chattering )

7
00:01:36,514 --> 00:01:38,304
( Eugeo gasping )

8
00:01:38,304 --> 00:01:39,724
Kirito: COME ON.

9
00:01:39,724 --> 00:01:41,104
( goblins laughing )

10
00:01:43,184 --> 00:01:44,394
( Eugeo gasps )

11
00:01:44,394 --> 00:01:47,484
Kirito: EUGEO, CALM DOWN.

12
00:01:47,484 --> 00:01:48,694
( Eugeo grunts )

13
00:01:51,824 --> 00:01:53,404
Kirito: WHEN I COUNT THREE,

14
00:01:53,404 --> 00:01:55,454
WE’LL CHARGE
PAST THE FOUR GUYS COMING

15
00:01:55,454 --> 00:01:57,534
AND KNOCK OUT THEIR FIRES.

16
00:01:57,534 --> 00:01:59,284
Eugeo: O-OKAY.

17
00:01:59,284 --> 00:02:02,124
Kirito: YOU CAN USE
THAT THING FOR LIGHT.

18
00:02:05,664 --> 00:02:08,544
WHEN THE FIRES GO OUT,
FIND A SWORD, AND GRAB IT.

19
00:02:08,544 --> 00:02:10,424
LEAVE THE BIG GUY TO ME.

20
00:02:10,424 --> 00:02:14,924
HE WON’T GO DOWN EASY,
SO KEEP THE OTHERS OFF MY BACK.

21
00:02:14,924 --> 00:02:18,804
Eugeo: BUT I-I NEVER FOUGHT
WITH A SWORD BEFORE.

22
00:02:18,804 --> 00:02:21,264
Kirito: SWING IT LIKE YOUR AX.
COME ON!

23
00:02:21,264 --> 00:02:22,434
ONE...

24
00:02:22,434 --> 00:02:24,144
TWO...

25
00:02:24,144 --> 00:02:25,274
THREE!

26
00:02:27,314 --> 00:02:29,444
( yells )

27
00:02:29,444 --> 00:02:30,694
( goblin grunts )

28
00:02:30,694 --> 00:02:32,194
( goblins grunting )

29
00:02:36,494 --> 00:02:37,494
Leader: HMM?

30
00:02:38,664 --> 00:02:39,574
HMM?

31
00:02:40,664 --> 00:02:42,744
Kirito: EUGEO!

32
00:02:42,744 --> 00:02:45,084
DON’T THINK!
JUST START SWINGING!

33
00:02:46,914 --> 00:02:48,674
Eugeo: HE MAKES IT
SOUND SO EASY.

34
00:02:49,794 --> 00:02:50,884
( goblins gasp )

35
00:02:53,594 --> 00:02:55,964
( goblins stammering )

36
00:02:57,344 --> 00:02:59,224
Eugeo: I-IT’S THE LIGHT.

37
00:02:59,224 --> 00:03:00,894
THEY’RE AFRAID OF THE LIGHT!

38
00:03:05,394 --> 00:03:06,774
( ice tinkling )

39
00:03:06,774 --> 00:03:09,564
( leader roars )

40
00:03:09,564 --> 00:03:13,154
I AM THE GREAT UGACHI,
THE LIZARD KILLER.

41
00:03:13,154 --> 00:03:14,904
YOU DARE CHALLENGE ME?

42
00:03:17,284 --> 00:03:19,824
Kirito: I’M NOT
JUST GONNA CHALLENGE YOU.

43
00:03:19,824 --> 00:03:21,534
I’LL KILL YOU!

44
00:03:21,534 --> 00:03:23,284
( Ugachi growls )

45
00:03:23,284 --> 00:03:24,624
Kirito: HAH!

46
00:03:35,424 --> 00:03:37,804
( woman vocalizing )

47
00:03:40,684 --> 00:03:42,264
( Ugachi growls )

48
00:03:56,274 --> 00:03:57,324
Kirito: SWORD SKILL...

49
00:03:58,784 --> 00:04:00,744
SHARP NAIL!

50
00:04:00,744 --> 00:04:02,074
( Ugachi grunts )

51
00:04:03,574 --> 00:04:05,164
( groans )

52
00:04:09,414 --> 00:04:11,084
♪

53
00:04:16,464 --> 00:04:18,134
( Kirito groaning )

54
00:04:19,264 --> 00:04:21,884
( Eugeo gasps ) KIRITO!

55
00:04:21,884 --> 00:04:23,934
( Kirito panting ) GOD.

56
00:04:23,934 --> 00:04:26,764
V.R. NEVER HURT...

57
00:04:26,764 --> 00:04:28,564
LIKE THIS!

58
00:04:28,564 --> 00:04:30,894
Ugachi: YOU ROTTEN
LITTLE IUM BRAT!

59
00:04:30,894 --> 00:04:33,604
TAKE MY ARM?! SHAME ME?!

60
00:04:33,604 --> 00:04:36,234
( groans )

61
00:04:36,234 --> 00:04:39,574
( roars )

62
00:04:39,574 --> 00:04:40,694
( panting )

63
00:04:40,694 --> 00:04:44,204
YOU PAY IN BLOOD!

64
00:04:50,254 --> 00:04:51,874
I RIP YOU IN HALF,

65
00:04:51,874 --> 00:04:53,874
EAT YOUR GUTS,

66
00:04:53,874 --> 00:04:55,754
TEACH YOU LESSON IN SHAME!

67
00:04:55,754 --> 00:04:57,714
( yells )

68
00:04:57,714 --> 00:05:00,304
( Kirito yells )

69
00:05:10,394 --> 00:05:11,854
( Eugeo gasps )

70
00:05:11,854 --> 00:05:13,734
( Ugachi growls )

71
00:05:15,814 --> 00:05:16,734
Eugeo: I’M SCARED...

72
00:05:19,614 --> 00:05:23,744
BUT I CAN’T JUST STAND HERE!

73
00:05:23,744 --> 00:05:26,324
I CAN’T MAKE THE SAME MISTAKE
I MADE WITH ALICE.

74
00:05:26,324 --> 00:05:27,534
( Kirito groans )

75
00:05:27,534 --> 00:05:28,784
( gasps )

76
00:05:28,784 --> 00:05:30,454
( Ugachi growls )

77
00:05:35,964 --> 00:05:38,674
( Kirito gasping )

78
00:05:38,674 --> 00:05:40,674
( Ugachi panting )

79
00:05:40,674 --> 00:05:42,634
( Kirito gasping )

80
00:05:42,634 --> 00:05:43,764
Ugachi: DIE!

81
00:05:43,764 --> 00:05:46,594
Eugeo: KIRITO!

82
00:05:49,814 --> 00:05:50,814
THIS TIME...

83
00:05:53,854 --> 00:05:54,944
I’LL FIGHT...

84
00:05:57,904 --> 00:05:59,524
AND PROTECT MY FRIEND!

85
00:06:01,734 --> 00:06:02,904
Kirito: RUN, EUGEO!

86
00:06:02,904 --> 00:06:03,824
( Ugachi chuckles )

87
00:06:08,744 --> 00:06:10,704
( Eugeo gags )

88
00:06:10,704 --> 00:06:12,414
( Kirito gasps )

89
00:06:12,414 --> 00:06:13,794
( Ugachi chuckles )

90
00:06:13,794 --> 00:06:15,374
Kirito: EUGEO!

91
00:06:19,714 --> 00:06:21,344
( panting )

92
00:06:21,344 --> 00:06:22,554
EUGEO!

93
00:06:22,554 --> 00:06:24,054
( Eugeo gasping )

94
00:06:24,054 --> 00:06:25,764
♪

95
00:06:25,764 --> 00:06:26,844
( Kirito gasps )

96
00:06:26,844 --> 00:06:28,804
( Eugeo gags )

97
00:06:28,804 --> 00:06:30,394
Kirito: EUGEO.

98
00:06:31,724 --> 00:06:34,274
HANG ON, EUGEO, PLEASE!

99
00:06:35,984 --> 00:06:37,814
Eugeo: W-WE MADE A PROMISE...

100
00:06:37,814 --> 00:06:39,854
YOU, ME, AND ALICE.

101
00:06:39,854 --> 00:06:42,024
WE PROMISED WE’D...

102
00:06:42,024 --> 00:06:44,734
PROTECT EACH OTHER.

103
00:06:44,734 --> 00:06:47,494
I COULDN’T SIX YEARS AGO,

104
00:06:47,494 --> 00:06:51,324
BUT NOW, FINALLY...

105
00:06:53,084 --> 00:06:54,744
I GOT TO.

106
00:06:56,914 --> 00:06:57,664
( Kirito gasps )

107
00:06:57,664 --> 00:06:59,624
♪

108
00:07:06,014 --> 00:07:08,434
Kirito: THAT’S RIGHT.

109
00:07:08,434 --> 00:07:09,804
I COULDN’T EITHER.

110
00:07:13,644 --> 00:07:15,974
Ugachi: YOUR TURN NOW.

111
00:07:17,814 --> 00:07:19,694
( Kirito yells )

112
00:07:25,034 --> 00:07:27,494
Ugachi: NOW YOU DIE,

113
00:07:27,494 --> 00:07:29,614
LIKE PATHETIC IUM YOU ARE!

114
00:07:32,574 --> 00:07:34,494
♪

115
00:07:36,244 --> 00:07:37,794
Kirito: MY NAME’S KIRITO,

116
00:07:37,794 --> 00:07:40,044
KIRITO THE SWORDSMAN!

117
00:07:40,044 --> 00:07:43,384
Ugachi: EITHER WAY, YOU DIE!

118
00:07:43,384 --> 00:07:46,884
Kirito: MAYBE HE’S A FLUCTLIGHT,
LIKE EVERYONE ELSE.

119
00:07:46,884 --> 00:07:48,974
( Ugachi roars )

120
00:07:48,974 --> 00:07:49,974
STILL...

121
00:07:51,804 --> 00:07:54,014
IF I DON’T KILL HIM,
HE’LL KILL US!

122
00:07:55,104 --> 00:07:57,684
SWORD SKILL...

123
00:07:57,684 --> 00:08:00,274
SONIC LEAP!

124
00:08:01,734 --> 00:08:03,944
( Ugachi yells )

125
00:08:15,164 --> 00:08:17,454
Kirito: FIGHT’S OVER.
YOUR BOSS IS DEAD.

126
00:08:17,454 --> 00:08:20,334
YOU WANNA DIE THE SAME WAY,
THEN STEP UP!

127
00:08:20,334 --> 00:08:25,504
BUT IF YOU WANNA LIVE, THEN GO
BACK TO THE DARK TERRITORY!

128
00:08:25,504 --> 00:08:27,384
( goblins stammering )

129
00:08:34,894 --> 00:08:36,554
( Kirito gasping )

130
00:08:38,104 --> 00:08:39,524
HANG IN THERE.

131
00:08:42,064 --> 00:08:43,104
( gasps )

132
00:08:45,734 --> 00:08:47,984
SELKA! COME ON! WAKE UP!

133
00:08:47,984 --> 00:08:49,444
( Selka groans )

134
00:08:50,994 --> 00:08:53,664
KIRITO, WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

135
00:08:53,664 --> 00:08:55,124
Kirito: WE CAME
TO TAKE YOU BACK HOME.

136
00:08:55,124 --> 00:08:56,624
CAN YOU WALK OKAY?

137
00:08:56,624 --> 00:08:58,744
Selka: IN A BIT.
MY LEGS ARE NUMB AND--

138
00:08:58,744 --> 00:08:59,834
( yelps )

139
00:09:01,044 --> 00:09:02,624
HEY, PUT ME DOWN!

140
00:09:02,624 --> 00:09:04,874
Kirito: EUGEO NEEDS YOU.
HE’S HURT BAD.

141
00:09:04,874 --> 00:09:05,924
HE’S DYING!

142
00:09:05,924 --> 00:09:07,044
( Selka gasps )

143
00:09:10,094 --> 00:09:13,054
M-MY SACRED ART SKILLS
AREN’T ENOUGH.

144
00:09:13,054 --> 00:09:15,844
THE WOUND IS MUCH TOO DEEP.

145
00:09:15,844 --> 00:09:17,554
Kirito: BUT YOU CAN
AT LEAST TRY.

146
00:09:17,554 --> 00:09:19,394
YOU’RE ALICE’S SISTER.
YOU CAN DO THIS.

147
00:09:21,524 --> 00:09:24,234
Selka: ALL I CAN HEAL
ARE SIMPLE SCRATCHES.

148
00:09:24,234 --> 00:09:27,694
IF ALICE WERE HERE, SHE COULD
HELP HIM MORE THAN I COULD.

149
00:09:27,694 --> 00:09:29,654
Kirito: LOOK,
EUGEO’S HURT ’CAUSE HE CAME

150
00:09:29,654 --> 00:09:31,824
TO SAVE YOU, SELKA, NOT ALICE!

151
00:09:31,824 --> 00:09:33,654
HE’S HERE ’CAUSE OF YOU!

152
00:09:33,654 --> 00:09:35,614
( Selka gasps )

153
00:09:35,614 --> 00:09:37,324
HMM.

154
00:09:37,324 --> 00:09:40,244
THE USUAL HEALING ARTS
WOULD TAKE TOO LONG.

155
00:09:40,244 --> 00:09:43,464
I’LL HAVE TO TRY A DANGEROUS
HIGH-LEVEL ONE INSTEAD.

156
00:09:43,464 --> 00:09:47,464
KIRITO, I’M GOING TO NEED
YOUR HELP TO MAKE THIS WORK.

157
00:09:47,464 --> 00:09:50,174
Kirito: OKAY, YOU GOT IT.
WHAT DO I DO?

158
00:09:50,174 --> 00:09:51,674
Selka: GIVE ME YOUR LEFT HAND.

159
00:09:55,804 --> 00:09:58,344
I’VE NEVER DONE THIS BEFORE,
AND IF I FAIL,

160
00:09:58,344 --> 00:10:00,224
THERE’S A CHANCE
BOTH OF US WILL DIE.

161
00:10:00,224 --> 00:10:02,274
I JUST WANT YOU TO KNOW THAT.

162
00:10:02,274 --> 00:10:04,934
Kirito: IF THAT HAPPENS,
MAKE SURE IT ONLY KILLS ME.

163
00:10:04,934 --> 00:10:07,064
LET’S DO THIS.

164
00:10:07,064 --> 00:10:08,904
Selka: MM-HMM.

165
00:10:08,904 --> 00:10:10,524
SYSTEM CALL.

166
00:10:11,654 --> 00:10:14,864
TRANSFER HUMAN UNIT DURABILITY.

167
00:10:14,864 --> 00:10:16,654
RIGHT HAND TO LEFT.

168
00:10:16,654 --> 00:10:18,534
( Kirito wincing )

169
00:10:23,544 --> 00:10:27,124
SHE’S TRANSFERRING HER LIFE
AND MINE TO HIM.

170
00:10:30,094 --> 00:10:31,094
Selka: KIRITO...

171
00:10:31,094 --> 00:10:34,134
CAN YOU KEEP GOING?

172
00:10:34,134 --> 00:10:35,974
Kirito: I’M OKAY.

173
00:10:35,974 --> 00:10:38,934
DON’T STOP. GIVE HIM MORE.

174
00:10:41,264 --> 00:10:43,184
( wincing )

175
00:10:44,934 --> 00:10:45,984
( gasps )

176
00:10:45,984 --> 00:10:48,484
Girl: KIRITO, EUGEO,

177
00:10:48,484 --> 00:10:51,194
COME AND FIND ME.
I AM WAITING...

178
00:10:53,614 --> 00:10:56,824
AT THE TOP
OF THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL.

179
00:10:56,824 --> 00:10:57,784
( Kirito gasps )

180
00:10:59,534 --> 00:11:01,664
Girl: I WILL WAIT THERE
FOR YOU BOTH.

181
00:11:02,994 --> 00:11:04,874
Kirito: WHO WAS THAT?

182
00:11:04,874 --> 00:11:05,954
( gasps )

183
00:11:05,954 --> 00:11:06,964
( Selka gasps )

184
00:11:06,964 --> 00:11:08,794
K-KIRITO!

185
00:11:10,174 --> 00:11:11,174
( birds chirping )

186
00:11:11,174 --> 00:11:12,964
( ax chops )

187
00:11:15,094 --> 00:11:16,014
Eugeo: 50!

188
00:11:18,684 --> 00:11:20,594
( panting )

189
00:11:22,014 --> 00:11:24,014
Kirito: HOW’S YOUR WOUND DOING?
BETTER?

190
00:11:24,014 --> 00:11:27,234
Eugeo: MUCH BETTER.
ALL I NEEDED WAS A DAY’S REST,

191
00:11:27,234 --> 00:11:28,354
AND IT’S ALMOST HEALED.

192
00:11:28,354 --> 00:11:29,854
( winces )

193
00:11:29,854 --> 00:11:32,064
Kirito: I’VE BEEN
WANTING TO ASK YOU

194
00:11:32,064 --> 00:11:33,484
ABOUT SOMETHING YOU SAID

195
00:11:33,484 --> 00:11:35,904
BACK IN THE CAVE
RIGHT BEFORE YOU PASSED OUT.

196
00:11:37,284 --> 00:11:39,074
I DON’T KNOW IF YOU REMEMBER,

197
00:11:39,074 --> 00:11:40,664
BUT IT SOUNDED LIKE YOU THOUGHT

198
00:11:40,664 --> 00:11:42,954
YOU, ALICE, AND ME
WERE FRIENDS BEFORE.

199
00:11:42,954 --> 00:11:44,244
Eugeo: YES, I REMEMBER,

200
00:11:44,244 --> 00:11:45,624
BUT WE ONLY JUST MET,

201
00:11:45,624 --> 00:11:48,204
SO I DON’T KNOW
WHERE ALL THAT CAME FROM.

202
00:11:48,204 --> 00:11:51,674
IT’S LIKE AT THAT MOMENT
I COULD SEE IT AS CLEAR AS DAY,

203
00:11:51,674 --> 00:11:53,464
YOU, ALICE, AND ME.

204
00:11:53,464 --> 00:11:57,964
WE WERE BORN ON THE SAME DAY
AND GREW UP TOGETHER HERE.

205
00:11:57,964 --> 00:12:01,224
WE WERE EVEN TOGETHER
THE DAY ALICE WAS TAKEN AWAY.

206
00:12:01,224 --> 00:12:03,224
Kirito: THAT’S WEIRD.

207
00:12:03,224 --> 00:12:05,604
BY THE WAY,
WHEN SELKA WAS HEALING YOU,

208
00:12:05,604 --> 00:12:09,144
YOU DIDN’T HAPPEN TO HEAR,
LIKE, A VOICE, DID YOU?

209
00:12:09,144 --> 00:12:11,064
Eugeo: NO. I WAS
TOTALLY UNCONSCIOUS,

210
00:12:11,064 --> 00:12:12,404
SO I DIDN’T HEAR A THING.

211
00:12:12,404 --> 00:12:14,404
WHY? DID YOU HEAR A VOICE?

212
00:12:14,404 --> 00:12:16,904
Kirito: NAH. GUESS I DREAMED IT.

213
00:12:16,904 --> 00:12:18,364
FORGET I ASKED.

214
00:12:18,364 --> 00:12:20,994
OH, WELL. TIME TO GET TO WORK.

215
00:12:20,994 --> 00:12:23,074
Eugeo: RIGHT. HERE YOU GO.

216
00:12:23,074 --> 00:12:25,244
( blade rings )

217
00:12:25,244 --> 00:12:26,914
Kirito: I’M GONNA USE THIS.

218
00:12:26,914 --> 00:12:28,244
( Eugeo gasps )

219
00:12:32,214 --> 00:12:33,794
WAIT. BUT HOW--

220
00:12:33,794 --> 00:12:37,054
YOU CAN--YOU CAN
WIELD THE SWORD?!

221
00:12:38,554 --> 00:12:40,264
Kirito: YOU MIGHT
WANNA STAND BACK.

222
00:12:45,144 --> 00:12:47,394
( deep breath )

223
00:12:47,394 --> 00:12:49,724
’CAUSE OF THAT FIGHT
WITH THE GOBLINS,

224
00:12:49,724 --> 00:12:52,354
NOW MY OBJECT CONTROL
AUTHORITY’S

225
00:12:52,354 --> 00:12:53,774
HIGHER THAN THE SWORD’S.

226
00:12:55,154 --> 00:12:56,364
HERE GOES.

227
00:12:56,364 --> 00:12:58,824
( yells )

228
00:13:08,204 --> 00:13:09,744
NICE.

229
00:13:09,744 --> 00:13:11,334
( Eugeo gasps )

230
00:13:14,214 --> 00:13:16,964
Kirito: I BET YOU CAN SWING IT
JUST AS EASY.

231
00:13:16,964 --> 00:13:18,844
♪

232
00:13:27,104 --> 00:13:28,014
( Eugeo gasps )

233
00:13:30,104 --> 00:13:32,104
KIRITO, WILL YOU...

234
00:13:32,104 --> 00:13:33,814
Kirito: HMM?

235
00:13:33,814 --> 00:13:35,564
( hand scrapes )

236
00:13:35,564 --> 00:13:38,234
Eugeo: WILL YOU
TEACH ME TO USE A SWORD?

237
00:13:38,234 --> 00:13:39,694
( Kirito gasps )

238
00:13:39,694 --> 00:13:41,694
Eugeo: IF SO,
I CAN GO GET ALICE BACK.

239
00:13:43,074 --> 00:13:45,074
Kirito: EUGEO.

240
00:13:45,074 --> 00:13:47,914
Eugeo: ALICE AND HER FAMILY
HAVE SUFFERED SO MUCH,

241
00:13:47,914 --> 00:13:49,874
ALL BECAUSE OF ME.

242
00:13:49,874 --> 00:13:52,754
♪

243
00:13:57,834 --> 00:13:58,754
( blade thumps )

244
00:14:00,174 --> 00:14:02,214
I COULDN’T SAVE HER.

245
00:14:02,214 --> 00:14:04,384
I DON’T KNOW WHY,
BUT I COULDN’T,

246
00:14:04,384 --> 00:14:08,764
AND, FOR THE PAST SIX YEARS,
I NEVER STOPPED REGRETTING IT.

247
00:14:11,564 --> 00:14:14,354
I-I WANT TO BECOME STRONG

248
00:14:14,354 --> 00:14:17,354
SO I-I CAN FIGHT,

249
00:14:17,354 --> 00:14:20,024
SO I CAN KEEP
FROM MAKING THE SAME MISTAKE!

250
00:14:22,654 --> 00:14:25,864
SO I CAN GET BACK
WHAT I LOST YEARS AGO.

251
00:14:25,864 --> 00:14:28,364
THAT’S WHY--

252
00:14:28,364 --> 00:14:30,074
THAT’S WHY I WANT
TO BECOME A SWORDSMAN!

253
00:14:32,334 --> 00:14:34,414
Kirito: ALL RIGHT, THEN.
YOU’RE ON.

254
00:14:34,414 --> 00:14:37,004
I’LL TEACH YOU
EVERYTHING I KNOW.

255
00:14:37,004 --> 00:14:38,004
( Eugeo gasps )

256
00:14:40,084 --> 00:14:41,844
Kirito: THE TRAINING’S
GONNA BE TOUGH, THOUGH.

257
00:14:43,964 --> 00:14:46,174
Eugeo: THAT’S WHAT I’M HOPING.

258
00:14:49,554 --> 00:14:51,224
BEFORE WE START,

259
00:14:51,224 --> 00:14:55,144
DO YOU REMEMBER
WHAT YOUR SWORD STYLE IS CALLED?

260
00:14:55,144 --> 00:14:55,934
Kirito: MM...

261
00:14:57,274 --> 00:14:58,314
( grunts )

262
00:14:58,314 --> 00:15:00,154
YEAH, I REMEMBER.

263
00:15:02,274 --> 00:15:04,864
IT’S THE AINCRAD STYLE.

264
00:15:04,864 --> 00:15:07,244
♪

265
00:15:19,374 --> 00:15:20,834
( chuckles )

266
00:15:25,674 --> 00:15:27,514
ALL RIGHT, EUGEO, FINISH IT.

267
00:15:27,514 --> 00:15:29,094
( Eugeo grunts )

268
00:15:41,314 --> 00:15:43,774
( yells )

269
00:15:45,364 --> 00:15:48,824
( blade rings )

270
00:15:53,574 --> 00:15:54,914
( man gasps ) HEY! LOOKIT!

271
00:15:54,914 --> 00:15:55,834
Man #2: AT WHAT?

272
00:15:55,834 --> 00:15:58,504
( townsfolk murmuring )

273
00:16:09,134 --> 00:16:10,804
♪

274
00:16:13,094 --> 00:16:15,014
Eugeo: THIS IS LIKE A DREAM.

275
00:16:15,014 --> 00:16:16,684
I NEVER THOUGHT
THIS DAY WOULD COME.

276
00:16:18,564 --> 00:16:21,274
I DIDN’T BELIEVE
IN DESTINY BEFORE,

277
00:16:21,274 --> 00:16:22,354
BUT NOW...

278
00:16:24,564 --> 00:16:28,484
KIRITO, MY CALLING
WASN’T MY DESTINY.

279
00:16:28,484 --> 00:16:29,744
FOR THE PAST SIX YEARS,

280
00:16:29,744 --> 00:16:32,114
I’VE BEEN WAITING
FOR YOU TO COME.

281
00:16:33,954 --> 00:16:36,284
Kirito: YEAH, MAYBE YOU WERE.

282
00:16:37,494 --> 00:16:39,414
BUT THEN AGAIN,

283
00:16:39,414 --> 00:16:42,874
MAYBE I WOKE UP HERE
JUST SO I COULD MEET YOU.

284
00:16:44,044 --> 00:16:46,044
( overlapping chatter,
laughter )

285
00:16:46,044 --> 00:16:48,214
( musicians playing )

286
00:16:56,054 --> 00:16:57,724
( Kirito sighing )

287
00:16:57,724 --> 00:17:00,144
- Selka: WHY ARE YOU HERE ALONE?
- Kirito: HMM?

288
00:17:00,144 --> 00:17:03,024
Kirito: OH. EUGEO’S
WITH YOUR DAD SOMEWHERE,

289
00:17:03,024 --> 00:17:04,524
TALKIN’ ABOUT STUFF.

290
00:17:04,524 --> 00:17:06,444
Selka: OH. I SEE.

291
00:17:06,444 --> 00:17:08,944
I’M SURE HE’S GETTING
A LOT OF WELL-DESERVED PRAISE

292
00:17:08,944 --> 00:17:11,824
FOR CHOPPING DOWN
THE DEMON TREE.

293
00:17:11,824 --> 00:17:14,784
Kirito: AFTER ALL THE EFFORT
HE PUT IN, HE DESERVES IT.

294
00:17:14,784 --> 00:17:16,704
Selka: I’VE DECIDED
TO STUDY HARDER,

295
00:17:16,704 --> 00:17:18,584
SO I CAN BE AS GOOD
AT THE SACRED ARTS

296
00:17:18,584 --> 00:17:20,204
AS MY SISTER WAS.

297
00:17:20,204 --> 00:17:23,214
MM, NOT SO I CAN BE
LIKE HER, MIND YOU.

298
00:17:26,384 --> 00:17:29,134
I WASN’T TRYING TO COPY HER
BY GOING TO THE CAVE.

299
00:17:29,134 --> 00:17:31,924
I WOULD NEVER CROSS
INTO THE DARK TERRITORY.

300
00:17:31,924 --> 00:17:34,434
BUT I THOUGHT BY TAKING
THE SAME PATH SHE DID,

301
00:17:34,434 --> 00:17:36,844
I’D GET CLOSER TO HER SOMEHOW.

302
00:17:38,854 --> 00:17:42,314
I WANTED TO GO IN
AS FAR AS I COULD.

303
00:17:42,314 --> 00:17:45,694
IN A WAY, I GUESS
THE WHOLE POINT OF GOING THERE

304
00:17:45,694 --> 00:17:49,324
WAS TO PROVE TO MYSELF
I COULD NEVER TAKE HER PLACE.

305
00:17:49,324 --> 00:17:52,074
Kirito: NO,
BUT YOU’RE STILL AMAZING.

306
00:17:52,074 --> 00:17:53,284
Selka: ME?

307
00:17:53,284 --> 00:17:54,654
Kirito: WHAT OTHER GIRL HERE

308
00:17:54,654 --> 00:17:57,704
COULD WALK INTO THAT DARK CAVE
ALL BY HERSELF?

309
00:17:57,704 --> 00:18:00,584
I MEAN THAT’S SOMETHING
ONLY YOU COULD DO.

310
00:18:00,584 --> 00:18:02,584
Selka: ONLY I COULD DO?

311
00:18:02,584 --> 00:18:04,374
WHAT DO YOU MEAN BY THAT?

312
00:18:04,374 --> 00:18:07,384
Kirito: YOU’RE YOU,
NOT ALICE’S REPLACEMENT,

313
00:18:07,384 --> 00:18:10,544
AND YOU GOT SKILLS
NO ONE ELSE HERE HAS.

314
00:18:10,544 --> 00:18:12,344
WITH A LITTLE PRACTICE,
YOU’LL MASTER ’EM.

315
00:18:13,464 --> 00:18:14,514
( Selka giggles )

316
00:18:14,514 --> 00:18:16,054
( townsfolk gasp )

317
00:18:16,054 --> 00:18:18,684
Gasfut: MAY I HAVE
YOUR ATTENTION, PLEASE!

318
00:18:18,684 --> 00:18:22,814
THE GREATEST WISH OF RULID’S
FOUNDERS HAS BEEN FULFILLED.

319
00:18:22,814 --> 00:18:25,434
THE DEMON TREE
HAS BEEN FELLED AT LAST!

320
00:18:25,434 --> 00:18:27,404
( all cheering )

321
00:18:27,404 --> 00:18:31,574
Gasfut: SO LET US ALL GIVE
THANKS TO EUGEO, SON OF ORICK!

322
00:18:31,574 --> 00:18:33,654
( all cheering )

323
00:18:33,654 --> 00:18:37,494
Gasfut: ACCORDING TO THE LAWS,
WHEN ONE FINISHES THEIR CALLING,

324
00:18:37,494 --> 00:18:39,164
THEY HAVE EARNED
THE RIGHT TO CHOOSE

325
00:18:39,164 --> 00:18:41,244
WHAT THEIR NEXT CALLING
WILL BE.

326
00:18:41,244 --> 00:18:44,584
GO AHEAD, EUGEO.
MAKE YOUR CHOICE.

327
00:18:44,584 --> 00:18:46,464
( wind blowing )

328
00:18:47,714 --> 00:18:49,634
( townsfolk murmuring )

329
00:19:04,354 --> 00:19:05,354
Eugeo: I...

330
00:19:05,354 --> 00:19:06,274
Gasfut: HMM?

331
00:19:08,354 --> 00:19:10,944
Eugeo: I WILL BECOME
A SWORDSMAN!

332
00:19:10,944 --> 00:19:13,694
- ( Gasfut gasps )
- ( townsfolk murmuring )

333
00:19:13,694 --> 00:19:15,784
Eugeo: I SHALL TRAIN HARD

334
00:19:15,784 --> 00:19:18,324
AND JOURNEY TO CENTORIA.

335
00:19:18,324 --> 00:19:19,614
( Gasfut gasps )

336
00:19:19,614 --> 00:19:22,414
EUGEO, WHAT COULD YOU POSSIBLY--

337
00:19:26,874 --> 00:19:29,714
NO. I WON’T QUESTION YOU.

338
00:19:29,714 --> 00:19:33,544
IT IS YOUR CHURCH-GIVEN RIGHT
TO CHOOSE YOUR NEXT CALLING.

339
00:19:35,634 --> 00:19:37,344
AS RULID’S ELDER,

340
00:19:37,344 --> 00:19:40,514
I APPROVE EUGEO’S
NEW CALLING AS SWORDSMAN!

341
00:19:40,514 --> 00:19:42,434
( all cheering )

342
00:19:44,264 --> 00:19:47,274
( bell tolls )

343
00:19:47,274 --> 00:19:48,934
♪

344
00:19:53,194 --> 00:19:54,234
Eugeo: SELKA.

345
00:19:54,234 --> 00:19:55,274
Selka: MM?

346
00:19:55,274 --> 00:19:57,784
EUGEO.

347
00:19:57,784 --> 00:20:00,784
Eugeo: BEFORE I GO, I-I WANTED
TO TELL YOU SOMETHING.

348
00:20:00,784 --> 00:20:02,914
Selka: OH? WHAT IS IT?

349
00:20:04,284 --> 00:20:05,454
Eugeo: MY GOAL...

350
00:20:05,454 --> 00:20:06,874
IS TO GO TO CENTORIA

351
00:20:06,874 --> 00:20:08,834
AND BRING ALICE BACK HERE.

352
00:20:08,834 --> 00:20:11,424
Selka: I THOUGHT SO.

353
00:20:11,424 --> 00:20:12,884
Eugeo: FOR THE PAST SIX YEARS,

354
00:20:12,884 --> 00:20:14,674
IT’S ALL
I’VE BEEN THINKING ABOUT.

355
00:20:14,674 --> 00:20:19,724
BUT WITH MY CALLING, I HAD
NO IDEA HOW I’D GO ABOUT IT.

356
00:20:19,724 --> 00:20:21,094
( Selka sighs )

357
00:20:21,094 --> 00:20:23,684
Eugeo: THEN KIRITO
SUDDENLY SHOWED UP,

358
00:20:23,684 --> 00:20:26,474
AND BRINGING ALICE BACK
DIDN’T SEEM HOPELESS ANYMORE.

359
00:20:26,474 --> 00:20:27,854
FOR SOME REASON,

360
00:20:27,854 --> 00:20:30,064
I FEEL LIKE I CAN DO ANYTHING
WITH HIM AROUND.

361
00:20:30,064 --> 00:20:33,524
YOU AND YOUR FAMILY
HAVE SUFFERED SO MUCH,

362
00:20:33,524 --> 00:20:35,564
ALL ON ACCOUNT OF ME,

363
00:20:35,564 --> 00:20:39,364
SO I’LL BRING ALICE BACK
AND MAKE THINGS RIGHT.

364
00:20:40,784 --> 00:20:41,904
HAVE FAITH IN ME,

365
00:20:41,904 --> 00:20:43,784
AND WAIT FOR OUR RETURN.

366
00:20:45,204 --> 00:20:46,834
Selka: WELL, I CAN’T STOP YOU,

367
00:20:46,834 --> 00:20:48,454
BUT IF YOU INSIST...

368
00:20:48,454 --> 00:20:49,374
Eugeo: I DO.

369
00:20:52,294 --> 00:20:54,044
Selka: OKAY. I SHALL WAIT.

370
00:20:56,044 --> 00:20:58,634
JUST MAKE SURE
THE THREE OF YOU COME BACK.

371
00:20:58,634 --> 00:21:00,344
( Eugeo gasps )

372
00:21:00,344 --> 00:21:01,844
( sighs ) MM-HMM.

373
00:21:01,844 --> 00:21:05,094
I’LL MAKE SURE WE ALL
COME BACK SAFE! PROMISE!

374
00:21:05,094 --> 00:21:06,644
- ( Kirito chuckles )
- Selka: GOOD LUCK.

375
00:21:08,564 --> 00:21:10,474
♪

376
00:21:14,654 --> 00:21:16,404
Eugeo: SORRY
TO KEEP YOU WAITING.

377
00:21:16,404 --> 00:21:17,484
Kirito: NO WORRIES.

378
00:21:19,534 --> 00:21:21,614
Eugeo: WELL, THEN,
ARE YOU READY?

379
00:21:21,614 --> 00:21:23,824
Kirito: UH-HUH.

380
00:21:23,824 --> 00:21:26,784
Eugeo: I WONDER
WHAT CENTORIA WILL BE LIKE.

381
00:21:26,784 --> 00:21:28,414
Kirito: WHO KNOWS?

382
00:21:34,754 --> 00:21:38,464
( chuckles ) IT’S GOTTA BE
WAY BIGGER THAN RULID, RIGHT?

383
00:21:38,464 --> 00:21:40,844
( Eugeo laughs )
I CERTAINLY HOPE SO.

384
00:21:40,844 --> 00:21:42,764
( thunder rumbling )

385
00:21:46,144 --> 00:21:48,144
IT LOOKS LIKE RAIN’S COMING.

386
00:21:48,144 --> 00:21:50,724
WE SHOULD HURRY
BEFORE WE GET CAUGHT IN IT.

387
00:21:53,814 --> 00:21:54,694
WHAT’S WRONG?

388
00:21:54,694 --> 00:21:56,064
Kirito: HUH? WHAT?

389
00:21:56,064 --> 00:21:57,904
Eugeo: NEVER MIND. SHALL WE GO?

390
00:21:57,904 --> 00:21:59,324
( Kirito chuckles )

391
00:21:59,324 --> 00:22:00,234
YEAH.

392
00:22:03,324 --> 00:22:05,324
( thunder rumbling )

393
00:22:05,324 --> 00:22:06,324
♪

394
00:22:06,324 --> 00:22:08,244
( singing in Japanese )

395
00:22:42,654 --> 00:22:46,244
♪ THE IRIS TO YOU ♪
